{'symbol': 'WFC', 'date': '2022-11-01 10:00:00', 'title': 'WELLS FARGO NAMES KRISTY FERCHO AS HEAD OF DIVERSE SEGMENTS, REPRESENTATION AND INCLUSION', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WELLS FARGO (NYSE: WFC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT KRISTY FERCHO, HEAD OF WELLS FARGO HOME LENDING, HAS BEEN NAMED THE COMPANY'S NEW HEAD OF DIVERSE SEGMENTS, REPRESENTATION AND INCLUSION (DSRI)."}